{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A ream of paper containing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a39b14023c98c943554d150561aacc188c4ce26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> sheets is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cm thick. Approximately how many sheets of this type of paper would there be in a stack <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/0548d22c8d43aa7314709ed34e7c106d4057beb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> cm high?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/437d5e3d3b118e1bc912d19ed4d04d08b1dff88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 250 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 550 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 667 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 750 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each sheet is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41dc562f52cd771ec40c4ef09e92e002118f239.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{500} = 0.01\\ \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"38\" /> thick, so a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909bd881e51b2e5a6d00e4001a7fbdce4e848265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5\\ \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> stack contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/7/707f6104a5ea6895c1ac3c9a1fffdd8df8682872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7.5}{0.01} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 750}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" /> sheets.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since each sheet has the same thickness, the number of sheets in a stack is directly proportional to the thickness of a stack.  \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of sheets in a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909bd881e51b2e5a6d00e4001a7fbdce4e848265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5\\ \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> stack.\nThen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df6e45e600cc69b0248ac5dab91c326943c54a73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{500}=\\frac{7.5}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/5/675781928495a2e7c1f8766e9e6b93a5d602d310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x=3750$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/b/fbb6bc7d2d6d3a3d3d879de3550441d291a79441.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 750}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~GrantStar\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using dimensional analysis with the conversion factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d5e624ddfbed80575ead235da6a7b8d6ee0ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{500\\ \\text{sheets}}{5\\ \\text{cm}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b02327114e7129043384f4923901a61bfc09ae7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7.5\\ \\text{cm})\\left(\\frac{500\\ \\text{sheets}}{5\\ \\text{cm}}\\right) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 750}\\ \\text{sheets}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"322\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each centimeter of a stack contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be94dd4d8a6fe6a5db202e1afea3eb8b4063faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{500}{5} = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" /> sheets of paper, so a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909bd881e51b2e5a6d00e4001a7fbdce4e848265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5\\ \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> stack must contain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/5/5450b94e68c934a0382ac0f4cdd62f9f1b6aaed2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5 \\cdot 100 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 750}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" /> sheets of paper.\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909bd881e51b2e5a6d00e4001a7fbdce4e848265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5\\ \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> stack is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> times as thick as a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/f/76f92695b489a529448aab1c22afb56c44b71a8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\ \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> stack, a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909bd881e51b2e5a6d00e4001a7fbdce4e848265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5\\ \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> stack contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/c/66cdf237d7e01ba50fb249e05f806d264888827e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5 \\cdot 500  = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 750}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" /> sheets of paper. \n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shriya2\" title=\"Shriya2\">Shriya2</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Dp1i5sCWN_c\">https://youtu.be/Dp1i5sCWN_c</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title